Let me also check if there are any issues with the implementation in `news_repository_impl.dart`:

Looking at my implementation:
```dart
@override
  Stream<List<NewsModel>> loadNewsFeedStream(NewsFeedFilter filter) async* {
    // 1. Мгновенно эмитим кэш (если есть).
    List<NewsModel> cached = await _dbDatasource.getNewsList();
    yield cached;

    // 2. В фоне запрашиваем сеть и обновляем кэш.
    try {
      final fresh = await _restDatasource.getNewsList();
      if (fresh.isNotEmpty) {
        await _dbDatasource.saveNewsList(fresh);
        yield fresh;
      } else if (cached.isEmpty) {
        // Если кэш пуст и сеть вернула пусто — эмитим пустой список.
        yield const [];
      }
    } catch (_) {}
  }
```

This looks correct for cache-then-network:
1. First yield = cached data immediately
2. Then fetch from network in background
3. If network returns fresh data, save to DB and emit updated list
4. If error occurs during network request, silently ignore (keep showing cached data)

